### RequestAnimationFrame Throttling

Animációk optimalizálása:

```javascript
let ticking = false;

function updateGlowPosition(x, y) {
    // Expensive DOM operations here
}

document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
    if (!ticking) {
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
            updateGlowPosition(e.clientX, e.clientY);
            ticking = false;
        });
        ticking = true;
    }
});
```

### CSS Paint API (Houdini)

Modern böngészőkben a CSS Paint API custom renderelést tesz lehetővé:

```javascript
// glow-worklet.js
class GlowPainter {
    paint(ctx, size, properties) {
        const gradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(
            size.width / 2,
            size.height / 2,
            0,
            size.width / 2,
            size.height / 2,
            size.width / 2
        );

        gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3)');
        gradient.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(57, 255, 20, 0)');

        ctx.fillStyle = gradient;
        ctx.fillRect(0, 0, size.width, size.height);
    }
}

registerPaint('glow', GlowPainter);
